{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS3qqK8cz477HgCupLUs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QfmD8P3z7W1hQVjL8ZkHbA","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'E'\np='lib/screens/registration_screen.dart'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"import 'package:flutter/material.dart';\\n\",\"import 'package:flutter/material.dart';\\n\\nimport '../analytics.dart';\\n\",1)\ns=s.replace(\"  bool _terms = false;\\n\",\"  bool _terms = false;\\n  bool _emailStartedFired = false;\\n  bool _phoneStartedFired = false;\\n\",1)\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"decoration: const InputDecoration(labelText: 'Email'),\n              onChanged: (_) => setState(() {}),\"\"\",\"\"\"decoration: const InputDecoration(labelText: 'Email'),\n              onChanged: (_) {\n                if (!_emailStartedFired) {\n                  _emailStartedFired = true;\n                  Analytics.capture('registration_email_started');\n                }\n                setState(() {});\n              },\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"decoration: const InputDecoration(labelText: 'Phone'),\n              onChanged: (_) => setState(() {}),\"\"\",\"\"\"decoration: const InputDecoration(labelText: 'Phone'),\n              onChanged: (_) {\n                if (!_phoneStartedFired) {\n                  _phoneStartedFired = true;\n                  Analytics.capture('registration_phone_started');\n                }\n                setState(() {});\n              },\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"              onChanged: (v) => setState(() => _amount = v),\n\"\"\",\"\"\"              onChanged: (v) => setState(() => _amount = v),\n              // Fires once per drag, not on every step.\n              onChangeEnd: (v) => Analytics.capture(\n                  'loan_amount_changed', {'amount': v.round()}),\n\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"              onChanged: (v) => setState(() => _terms = v ?? false),\"\"\",\"\"\"              onChanged: (v) {\n                setState(() => _terms = v ?? false);\n                if (v == true) Analytics.capture('terms_accepted');\n              },\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"                  ? () => Navigator.of(context).pushNamed('/offers')\n\"\"\",\"\"\"                  ? () {\n                      Analytics.capture('registration_continue_tapped', {\n                        'amount': _amount.round(),\n                        'terms': _terms,\n                      });\n                      Navigator.of(context).pushNamed('/offers');\n                    }\n\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='lib/screens/offer_screen.dart'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"import 'package:flutter/material.dart';\\n\",\"import 'package:flutter/material.dart';\\n\\nimport '../analytics.dart';\\n\",1)\ns=s.replace(\"      body: ListView.builder(\",\"\"\"      // ScrollEndNotification: one event per scroll gesture, not per frame.\n      body: NotificationListener<ScrollEndNotification>(\n        onNotification: (n) {\n          Analytics.capture('offers_scrolled', {'offset': n.metrics.pixels});\n          return false;\n        },\n        child: ListView.builder(\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"        },\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\"\"\",\"\"\"        },\n        ),\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nE\ncat > ANSWER.md <<'E'\n# Analytics events implementation\n\nImplemented all six events from `docs/EVENTS.md` using `Analytics.capture`. Names and properties match the spec. No email or phone values are sent.\n\n- `registration_email_started` / `registration_phone_started`: fire in `onChanged` behind a per-screen-state `bool` flag, so once per visit and not once per keystroke.\n- `loan_amount_changed` (`amount`): fires from the Slider's `onChangeEnd`, so once per drag. `onChanged` only updates the UI.\n- `terms_accepted`: fires when the checkbox is ticked (not when unticked).\n- `registration_continue_tapped` (`amount`, `terms`): fires in the Continue button handler before navigation.\n- `offers_scrolled` (`offset`): fires from `NotificationListener<ScrollEndNotification>`, so once per scroll gesture, not on every scroll update.\n\n## Colleague's note\nApplied: the whole approach. The spec's \"started typing\" and \"moved the slider\" events sit naturally in `onChanged`, which would have sent one event per keystroke or slider step and burned the quota. I used the once-per-visit flags, `onChangeEnd` and `ScrollEndNotification` as the note describes. Not needed: the focus-lost variant, because no event carries a final field value.\n\nNot verified: I didn't run the app or `flutter analyze` (no Flutter run was done). `offers_scrolled` can still fire several times per visit, once per gesture. If that is too many, add a once-per-visit flag.\nE\ngit diff --stat"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1691,"cache_read_input_tokens":22644,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1691},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"76f40264-853b-48f4-8f96-cc78611ffb1d","uuid":"a61e3c47-3ff8-431d-8965-ae9ffefd646a","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:42:12.993Z","request_id":"req_011CgS3qq7DYdJMHJPMHGbhP","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01QfmD8P3z7W1hQVjL8ZkHbA":{"command":"cd /private/tmp/h-0Yjkzx && python3 - <<'E'\np='lib/screens/registration_screen.dart'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"import 'package:flutter/material.dart';\\n\",\"import 'package:flutter/material.dart';\\n\\nimport '../analytics.dart';\\n\",1)\ns=s.replace(\"  bool _terms = false;\\n\",\"  bool _terms = false;\\n  bool _emailStartedFired = false;\\n  bool _phoneStartedFired = false;\\n\",1)\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"decoration: const InputDecoration(labelText: 'Email'),\n              onChanged: (